### ===========================================
### Public Maintenance Companies API Tests
### ===========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### POST public maintenance company - 201 Created
### Used by the standalone Week 10 client. No session cookie or CSRF token is required.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/maintenance-companies
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Signal Support",
  "contactPhone": "+32 123 45 67",
  "contactEmail": "contact@signalsupport.example",
  "active": true,
  "since": "2024-01-15"
}

### POST public maintenance company - 400 Bad Request (missing name)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/maintenance-companies
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contactPhone": "+32 123 45 67",
  "contactEmail": "contact@signalsupport.example",
  "active": true,
  "since": "2024-01-15"
}

### POST public maintenance company - 400 Bad Request (invalid email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/maintenance-companies
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Signal Support",
  "contactPhone": "+32 123 45 67",
  "contactEmail": "not-an-email",
  "active": true,
  "since": "2024-01-15"
}

### POST public maintenance company - 400 Bad Request (future since date)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/maintenance-companies
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Signal Support",
  "contactPhone": "+32 123 45 67",
  "contactEmail": "contact@signalsupport.example",
  "active": true,
  "since": "2099-01-15"
}
